{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a custom split-section layout that combines image and text in a clean, editorial style.
    The section should have:
    1. Customizable background
    A solid background color block that I can fully customize (color picker + opacity).
    Option to set background as solid color, gradient, or image.
    2. Image area (left or right side)
    Image should cover slightly less than half of the section width (around 45%).
    Shape should be square or softly rounded rectangle with editable border radius.
    Option to move the image left, right, top, or bottom, so layout can alternate.
    Include manual alignment controls (arrows or position toggles):
    ↔ move horizontally
    ↕ move vertically
    ⤢ resize image area
    Image aspect ratio, width, and height must be fully editable individually.
    3. Text area (opposite side of image)
    Editable headline, paragraph, and small subheadline fields.
    Allow precise manual positioning of each text block — e.g. move up, down, left, or right within the section (using arrows or pixel inputs).
    Option to change font, size, spacing, and alignment (left/center/right) individually for every text element.
    4. Button
    Add a minimal button that looks like this:
    White background (or transparent)
    Outlined border in black or editable color
    Rounded corners
    Bold text inside (editable)
    Hover effect: background fills with border color and text color inverts
    Button text, color, and border must be individually editable.
    Option to control exact button position within the text area.
    5. Optional decorative elements
    Add the ability to place rotated text or repeating words vertically along the section edge (e.g., PAGE BY PAGE • PAGE BY PAGE).
    This vertical text should be fully editable (text, font, spacing, color, rotation angle).
    Option to toggle it on/off easily.
    6. Responsiveness
    On mobile, image appears above text, stacked vertically with spacing control.
    All paddings, margins, and text-image ratios must be fully editable for each breakpoint.
    7. Overall design tone
    Minimal, creative, and editor, the image has to be half of the background no a single reclagle, but half of the full section, its grea but add option to excatly move the text, like left right, on milimeneters, all of them even the bottom, make the text not go over the image but begin a bit after the centre on the other side of the image, okay this is great but I also need the same option as with the image that I can move it to right side or left with the texts, because now I only can have it on the left side it doesnt really work when the image is on left
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-split-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: {{ block.settings.section_height }}px;
  }

  .ai-split-section__bg-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: {% if block.settings.layout == 'image-left' %}row{% else %}row-reverse{% endif %};
  }

  .ai-split-section__image-half-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: {{ block.settings.image_width }}%;
    height: 100%;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-split-section__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center;
  }

  .ai-split-section__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: #f4f4f4;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-split-section__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    max-height: 400px;
  }

  .ai-split-section__bg-half-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ 100 | minus: block.settings.image_width }}%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.bg_color }};
    {% if block.settings.bg_type == 'gradient' %}
      background: {{ block.settings.bg_gradient }};
    {% elsif block.settings.bg_type == 'image' and block.settings.bg_image %}
      background-image: url('{{ block.settings.bg_image | image_url: width: 2000 }}');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-split-section__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: {% if block.settings.layout == 'image-left' %}{{ block.settings.image_width }}% 1fr{% else %}1fr {{ block.settings.image_width }}%{% endif %};
    align-items: {{ block.settings.vertical_align }};
    min-height: {{ block.settings.section_height }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .ai-split-section__image-spacer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-split-section__content-area-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: {% if block.settings.content_position == 'left' %}flex-start{% elsif block.settings.content_position == 'center' %}center{% else %}flex-end{% endif %};
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal }}px;
  }

  .ai-split-section__content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.content_vertical_align }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.content_padding }}px;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.content_max_width }}%;
    width: 100%;
    transform: translate({{ block.settings.content_offset_x }}px, {{ block.settings.content_offset_y }}px);
  }

  .ai-split-section__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.subheading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.subheading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subheading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.subheading_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_align }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.subheading_spacing }}px;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.subheading_transform }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.subheading_margin }}px;
    transform: translate({{ block.settings.subheading_offset_x }}px, {{ block.settings.subheading_offset_y }}px);
  }

  .ai-split-section__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_align }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.heading_line_height }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_spacing }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_margin }}px;
    transform: translate({{ block.settings.heading_offset_x }}px, {{ block.settings.heading_offset_y }}px);
  }

  .ai-split-section__text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.text_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.text_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.text_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.text_color }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.text_align }};
    line-height: {{ block.settings.text_line_height }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.text_spacing }}px;
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.text_margin }}px;
    transform: translate({{ block.settings.text_offset_x }}px, {{ block.settings.text_offset_y }}px);
  }

  .ai-split-section__button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: {% if block.settings.text_align == 'left' %}flex-start{% elsif block.settings.text_align == 'center' %}center{% else %}flex-end{% endif %};
    transform: translate({{ block.settings.button_offset_x }}px, {{ block.settings.button_offset_y }}px);
  }

  .ai-split-section__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
    border: {{ block.settings.button_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font_weight }};
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-split-section__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_bg_color }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
    border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_border_color }};
  }

  .ai-split-section__decorative-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    {% if block.settings.decorative_position == 'left' %}
      left: {{ block.settings.decorative_offset }}px;
    {% else %}
      right: {{ block.settings.decorative_offset }}px;
    {% endif %}
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%) rotate({{ block.settings.decorative_rotation }}deg);
    transform-origin: center;
    font-family: {{ block.settings.decorative_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.decorative_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.decorative_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.decorative_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.decorative_color }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.decorative_spacing }}px;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.decorative_transform }};
    white-space: nowrap;
    opacity: {{ block.settings.decorative_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-split-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .ai-split-section__bg-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
    }

    .ai-split-section__image-half-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      height: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_height }}px;
    }

    .ai-split-section__bg-half-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      min-height: 300px;
    }

    .ai-split-section__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .ai-split-section__image-spacer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: 100%;
      height: {{ block.settings.mobile_image_height }}px;
    }

    .ai-split-section__content-area-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_padding_bottom }}px;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .ai-split-section__content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      max-width: 100%;
      padding: 0;
      transform: translate(0, 0);
    }

    .ai-split-section__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_subheading_size }}px;
      transform: translate(0, 0);
    }

    .ai-split-section__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_size }}px;
      transform: translate(0, 0);
    }

    .ai-split-section__text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_text_size }}px;
      transform: translate(0, 0);
    }

    .ai-split-section__button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      transform: translate(0, 0);
    }

    .ai-split-section__decorative-text-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: {% if block.settings.decorative_hide_mobile %}none{% else %}block{% endif %};
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<div class="ai-split-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-split-section__bg-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-split-section__image-half-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.image %}
        <img
          src="{{ block.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 }}"
          alt="{{ block.settings.image.alt | escape }}"
          class="ai-split-section__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
          loading="lazy"
          width="{{ block.settings.image.width }}"
          height="{{ block.settings.image.height }}"
        >
      {% else %}
        <div class="ai-split-section__image-placeholder-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {{ 'image' | placeholder_svg_tag }}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="ai-split-section__bg-half-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>
  </div>

  {% if block.settings.decorative_enabled %}
    <div class="ai-split-section__decorative-text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {{ block.settings.decorative_text }}
    </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="ai-split-section__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-split-section__image-spacer-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

    <div class="ai-split-section__content-area-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-split-section__content-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.subheading != blank %}
          <div class="ai-split-section__subheading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.subheading }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-split-section__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.heading }}
          </h2>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-split-section__text-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.text }}
          </div>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.button_text != blank %}
          <div class="ai-split-section__button-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <a
              href="{{ block.settings.button_link }}"
              class="ai-split-section__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
            >
              {{ block.settings.button_text }}
            </a>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

